WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:01.042
Listen up!

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:04.337
Everyone is going to die.

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:08.591
Oh, not these people!

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:09.509
No, no, no, no!

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:10.301
Don't worry.

00:00:10.301 --> 00:00:12.929
I mean, sure, one day, they will die.

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:14.514
We all will! 

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:15.849
But the point is, 

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:16.808
they all need

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:19.436
 The Gentle Art of Swedish Death Cleaning.

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:22.397
What is Swedish Death Cleaning, you say?

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.357
Basically cleaning out your crap

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:25.859
 so that others don't have to do it

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:26.609
when you're gone. 

00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:28.403
If you can’t keep track of your things...

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:29.988
you have too many.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.491
When I'm done in here,

00:00:33.491 --> 00:00:34.951
 you're going to want to entertain.

00:00:36.244 --> 00:00:38.580
It's about discovering what's important to you.

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:41.207
You can't save everything!

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:41.916
This is Ella!

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.501
This is an inflatable wiener. 

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:44.669
Enough of this wiener talk. 

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:46.337
I'm getting horn - hungry, I meant.

00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:50.550
But they are here to make our lives better.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:53.136
There's a lot of life in death.

00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:55.889
The love gives you this kind of perspective,

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:56.890
this sharpness.

00:00:57.432 --> 00:00:58.850
I don't want to live this way.

00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:00.477
I need your help.

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:03.646
My mom really wants me to have this.

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:04.898
But you don't like it?

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:05.815
No I don’t.  

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:09.277
Let your home be a reflection of you.

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:10.987
The toughest thing I ever had to do

00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:12.739
 was tell my kids their mother was dead. 

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:15.283
Going through Death Cleaning has helped 

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:17.368
me become a fuller person.

00:01:17.368 --> 00:01:18.745
Life changing! 

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:19.496
Thank you! 

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:21.414
Look at the screen! They have Landon! 

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.583
This is not a show about death. 

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:25.585
It's about life. 

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:27.670
We say that Death Cleaning is for life.

00:01:27.837 --> 00:01:28.254
Yes!

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.090
So, it's about here and now.

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:31.758
I guess we do have a legacy.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.093
 Maybe everyone does, really.

00:01:33.551 --> 00:01:35.011
I knew that you guys were going

00:01:35.011 --> 00:01:36.179
to declutter my house.

00:01:36.554 --> 00:01:38.932
I didn't know you were going to declutter my soul.

